#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:8
msgid ""
"The most obvious change should be the location where the MODs / Extensions "
"are stored. In phpBB 3.0 all files were put into the core's root folder. In "
"phpBB 3.1 a special directory for extensions has been created. It's called "
"``ext/``."
msgstr ""
"Le changement le plus évident concerne l'emplacement de stockage des "
"MODs/extensions. Dans phpBB 3.0, tous les fichiers étaient placés dans le "
"dossier racine du cœur. Dans phpBB 3.1, un répertoire spécial pour les "
"extensions a été créé. Il s'appelle ``ext/``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:13
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Répertoire"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:15
msgid ""
"Each extension has its own directory. However, you must also use an "
