#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:468
msgid "Data Changes"
msgstr "Modifications de données"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:470
msgid ""
"The data changes, like adding modules, permissions and configs, are provided"
" with the ``update_data()`` function."
msgstr ""
"Les modifications de données, comme l'ajout de modules, de permissions et de"
" configurations, sont fournies via la fonction ``update_data()``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:473
msgid ""
"This function returns an array as well. The example for the 1.0.0 version "
